        "answer": {
          "short": "$a=\\frac{2s}{n}-\\ell$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2s&=n(a+\\ell)\\\\\\frac{2s}{n}&=a+\\ell\\\\a&=\\frac{2s}{n}-\\ell\\end{align*}$$",
